                    "area": {
                        "id": "area",
                        "table": "views",
                        "field": "area",
                        "content": "<p>Tick everyone on the renewal list sent across, then choose <em>Mark as renewed<\/em>. Anyone left unticked is not touched: their own cover runs out on its own date and they lapse in the ordinary way, which is what should happen to a member who has not renewed. Detaching is for somebody who has left altogether.<\/p>",
